    "id": "doc-disease-nasal_congestion",
    "title": "احتقان و گرفتگی بینی (Nasal Congestion (Nasal Obstruction))",
    "title_en": "Nasal Congestion (Nasal Obstruction) - OTC Clinical Protocol",
